    "gp_section_586505993328984923": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "e4460a03f85637ea359d33a0470deabaf1643ddfb36c6618168f30dd81a06e1e_1_1_0_0__1",
        "gg2trWMmJm8_text": "<p>I was so skeptical because I'd tried everything—three doctors, five supplements, nothing worked. But MenoMate is the real deal. My stomach is flatter, my mood swings are gone, and I feel like myself for the first time in two years</p>",
        "gg6vqRYi3u8_text": "<p>I was taking probiotics, turmeric, and hormone pills that barely worked. MenoMate replaced ALL of them! After two weeks, my hot flashes stopped, my stomach stayed flat, and I'm not snapping at my family anymore. I'm 52 and feel better than I did at 45!</p>",
        "ggEtPYbJjHu_text": "<p>Finally sleeping through the night</p>",
        "ggKXwqPfjxS_text": "<p>My menopause belly' is gone forever</p>",
        "ggS7RD-z-uF_text": "<p>Verified buyer</p>",
        "ggSurKoGGSu_text": "<p>Threw away</p><p>my other<br>supplements</p>",
        "ggkIHpeXZmL_text": "<p>Verified buyer</p>",
        "ggl9fq4jccF_text": "<p>Doona L.</p>",
        "ggqH6pwM142_text": "<p>Kimberly L.</p>",
        "ggrJ6aPfuW6_text": "<p>Verified buyer</p>",
        "gguP1oUZeoj_text": "<p>Hot flashes and joint pain used to wake me up every night—I felt like I was 80! Within three weeks of taking MenoMate, I'm sleeping peacefully with no night sweats and my knees don't ache. My belly looks flatter, and I'm back into my favorite jeans. Just two capsules instead of five different supplements!</p>",
        "ggzb2_IOCZu_text": "<p>Maria T.</p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-586505993328984923"
    },
