        "gg2U4rUu9JW_text": "<p>✔️ <strong>Therapeutic dosages</strong> - 350mg turmeric with 2000% better absorption, <i>not</i> 100-200mg \"fairy dust\" like others.</p><p>✔️ <strong>40mg DIM for hormone metabolism</strong> - the missing piece joint supplements ignore.</p><p>✔️ <strong>10 billion CFU probiotics</strong> for menopausal women - not generic strains.</p><p>✔️ <strong>90-day Money Back guarantee</strong> - <i>instead of</i> 30-day policies with fees.</p><p>✔️ <strong>100% vegan, allergen-free, hormone-free, natural ingredients</strong> - <i>unlike</i> most competitors with fillers.</p><p>✔️ <strong>Replaces multiple supplements</strong> - saves you $80+ monthly vs buying separately.<br><strong>✔️ </strong><a href=\"#gXbcVg9qLo\"><strong><u>3rd-party lab tested</u></strong></a><strong> and verified </strong>for safety and potency.</p>",
        "gg5M6rnKKNu_text": "<p>(Worth $219)</p>",
        "gg7IjDar5tH_viewLessText": "Show less",
        "gg7IjDar5tH_viewMoreText": "Show more",
        "gg9T8w1ZLGR_text": "<p>Finally, a natural solution that targets the root cause of these frustrating symptoms-not just the surface problems.</p>",
        "ggAHVwWaNjK_text": "<p><strong>Serving Size: </strong>2 capsules per serving (30 servings per container).</p><ul><li>Turmeric Root Extract (Curcuma longa L.) 350mg;</li><li>Inulin (Fructoligosaccharides) (from Chicory root) 337.5mg;</li><li>MenoMate Probiotic Blend 10B CFU: Bifidobacterium animalis subsp. Lactis, Bifidobacterium breve, Lactobacillus gasseri;</li><li>Curry Leaf Extract (Helichrysum italicum) 50mg;</li><li>Black Cohosh Powder Extract (Cimicifuga racemosa) (stem, root) 40mg;</li><li>DI-Indolylmethane (DIM) 40mg;</li><li>Moringa Leaf Extract (Moringa oleifera) 35mg;</li><li>Bioperine® Organic Black Pepper Extract (Piper nigrum) 3mg</li></ul>",
        "ggDaNtquojB_text": "<p>(Save up to $19.95)</p>",
        "ggEivNbV7f7_text": "<p>Free Dietitian's Menopause Meal Plan</p>",
        "ggItFjAm_L-_text": "<ul><li>Take <strong>2 capsules a day</strong>, preferably at the same time each day for consistent support.</li><li>Give your body at least <strong>2-3 months</strong> to fully adjust, though many users notice improvements sooner.</li><li><strong>Hydration &amp; Light Exercise</strong> amplify the benefits, helping you see faster, longer-lasting results.</li></ul>",
        "ggQtwQIsY72_label": "BUY NOW",
        "ggQtwQIsY72_outOfStockLabel": "Out of stock",
        "ggQtwQIsY72_unavailableLabel": "Unavailable",
        "ggVgGNGCW66_text": "<p>• Stubborn weight gain that won't budge despite<br>your efforts</p><p>• Aching joints that make you feel older than<br>your years</p><p>• Hot flashes &amp; night sweats that disrupt your<br>day and steal your sleep</p><p>• Mood swings that leave you feeling like a<br>stranger to yourself</p>",
        "ggXpWvSF_vs_text": "<p>90-Day Money Back Guarantee</p>",
        "ggYvV0nudYk_text": "<p>Free Shipping</p>",
        "ggrBEh5YmHG_childItem_0": "<p>Say Goodbye to Menopause Stress</p>",
        "ggrBEh5YmHG_childItem_1": "<p>Why MenoMate™ Works When Everything Else Has Failed You</p>",
        "ggrBEh5YmHG_childItem_2": "<p>Recommended Usage</p>",
        "ggrBEh5YmHG_childItem_3": "<p>MenoMate Ingredient Facts</p>",
        "ggrBEh5YmHG_childItem_4": "<p>Shipping Policy</p>",
        "ggyvoGNuEVd_text": "<p>If you relate to any of these, MenoMate is the<br>solution you've been waiting for:</p>",
        "gqmAwndk_oD_text": "<p>All USA orders arrives within 2 - 5 business days.<br>All UK, Europe, Canada, Australia &amp; New Zealand orderss<br>arrive within 6-15 days.<br>Click <a href=\"https://wellnessnest.co/policies/shipping-policy\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><u>HERE</u></strong></a> for more Shipping Policy.</p>",
