    "gp_section_586505993329181531": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "3a819c738688ccdfe9364756343e20dc0670ad1d3369d1a4ba6ddbbaec67eb78_1_1_0_0__1",
        "gg5MECoTpf4_text": "<p>Rachel Nguyen, BSc – Lead Nutrition Scientist</p>",
        "gg6zjYrBhTS_text": "<p>Elizabeth Ross,&nbsp;</p><p>OB/GYN</p>",
        "ggEi4nUmL56_text": "<p>With 15 years of clinical practice in holistic hormone health, Dr. Claire pinpoints the root causes of menopause symptoms—like hot flashes, mood swings, and stubborn weight gain. She laid the foundation for MenoMate’s powerful formula, ensuring each ingredient specifically targets menopausal discomfort.</p>",
        "ggVYb9EbXV3_text": "<p>\"In my practice, I've seen thousands of women apologize for 'complaining' about symptoms that are dramatically affecting their lives. You shouldn't have to choose between suffering through menopause or taking risky hormone replacement. That's exactly why I helped formulate MenoMate—safe, natural relief that actually works.\"</p>",
