        "ggkC6TVbg0Z_text": "Our Medical Advisory Board",
        "gglDGnuhn7u_text": "<p>Rachel harnesses her deep knowledge of plant-based extracts to calibrate every dose for maximum potency. By rigorously testing each batch, she guarantees MenoMate delivers fast, noticeable results—without harsh chemicals or fillers.</p>"
      },
