        "ggiH6P7Gnjh_text": "<p><strong>MenoMate™ is 3rd-party lab tested and verified for safety and potency.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>✅ Free from harmful bacteria like E. coli and Salmonella<br>✅ Passed all purity checks – no contaminants or adulterants<br>✅ Key ingredients like <strong>DIM (62.7 mg)</strong> and <strong>Prebiotics (322 mg)</strong> match or exceed label claims<br>✅ Made in a GMP-certified facility and approved for Amazon compliance</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>In short:</strong> MenoMate™ is clean, potent, and safe to take daily — exactly what your body deserves during menopause.</p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-586505993329247067"
    },
    "gp_section_586505993329312603": {
      "settings": {
