        "ggOEuiVp4xu_text": "<p><strong>What's Really Happening:</strong></p><p>When your hormones crash, your body slows down and starts storing fat around your middle. Plus, your digestion gets messed up, making you bloated and craving sweets.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>How MenoMate Helps:</strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:px;\"><strong>• Turmeric (350mg)</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:px;\">Speeds up your sluggish system and targets that stubborn belly fat.*</span><br><span style=\"font-size:px;\"><strong>• Inulin (337.5mg)</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:px;\">Feeds the good bacteria and stops those afternoon munchies.*</span><br><span style=\"font-size:px;\"><strong>• Probiotics (10 Billion CFU)</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:px;\">Fixes your digestion so you process food properly instead of storing it as fat.*</span></p>",
        "ggmxP750fB9_text": "<p><strong>The Biology:</strong><br>With lower estrogen, neurotransmitters responsible for mood regulation can fluctuate, causing mood swings, irritability, and anxiety.</p><p><strong>How MenoMate Helps:</strong></p><p><strong>• DIM (40mg)</strong><br>Supports the body’s estrogen metabolism, helping maintain hormonal balance.*</p><p><strong>• Probiotic Blend (10B CFU)</strong><br>Research suggests certain gut bacteria strains influence mood by interacting with the body’s stress and serotonin pathways.*</p><p><strong>• Turmeric Root Extract (350mg)</strong><br>Shown in studies to support a positive mood, aided by its antioxidant and anti-inflammatory properties.*</p>",
        "gguT-Ky7SOn_text": "<p><strong>The Biology:</strong><br>Hormone changes make your whole body more inflamed—that's why you wake up feeling like a rusty robot and your hip, knees hurt, frozen shoulder when you get up.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>How MenoMate Helps:</strong></p><p><strong>• Turmeric (350mg)</strong><br>Nature's strongest anti-inflammatory, like natural ibuprofen but easier on<br>your stomach.*<br><strong>• Black Cohosh (40mg)</strong><br>Helps turn down the volume on constant aching.*<br><strong>• Moringa (35mg)</strong><br>Works with turmeric to give you better relief.*<br><strong>• BioPerine® (3mg)</strong><br>Makes sure your body actually uses everything instead of flushing it away.*</p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-586505993329312603"
    },
